# Unit cube, one material per face, already grouped: six runs of two triangles.
# Exercises the simple case, where grouping by material needs no reordering.
# Winding is counter clockwise seen from outside, so every face's geometric normal points outward.

v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 1 1 0
v 0 1 0
v 0 0 1
v 1 0 1
v 1 1 1
v 0 1 1

usemtl front
f 5 6 7 8
usemtl back
f 1 4 3 2
usemtl right
f 2 3 7 6
usemtl left
f 1 5 8 4
usemtl top
f 4 8 7 3
usemtl bottom
f 1 2 6 5
